  "prefLabel": "Fis 2101.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 2101.01 Applicability. This chapter shall not apply to:\n\n(a) The actions of law enforcement officers and department personnel in the performance of their official duties; and\n\n(b) Any incidental interference arising from the lawful and normal activities of public land users.\n\nSource. #13752, eff 9-25-23",
